# College Bus Management System — Phase 1 Foundation Setup

Build the complete Phase 1 foundation of the college bus management system monorepo. The workspace at `college-bus-system` has a basic scaffolding (empty app shells for backend/mobile/admin + packages/shared with stub files). This plan sets up the local dev infrastructure, implements all shared code, creates the Prisma database schema, and builds all backend modules into a working API server.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **This is a large build.** I'll focus on getting the **backend + shared packages + local dev infrastructure** fully working first. The mobile app and admin panel will be built in a follow-up task, since they depend on the backend being functional.

> [!WARNING]
> **Cloud services (GCP, Firebase, MSG91, Upstash)** — I'll create placeholder service wrappers with environment variables. You'll need to create accounts and fill in credentials before those integrations work. The system will work locally with Docker PostgreSQL + Redis without any cloud accounts.

